<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Palabora awards 160 cents year div.</title>
<headline>Palabora awards 160 cents year div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Type of share: ordinary</p>
<p>Period: Year ended December 31, 1997</p>
<p>Interim div 160 cts</p>
<p>Pay date: June 27</p>
<p>Record date: June 6</p>
<p>Full name: Palabora Mining Company Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said it had secured a 445 million rand loan from a consortium of foreign banks to finance its 1.5 billion rand underground project.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
